WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.460
I was a copper-heavy cannonball fired at a comet.

2
00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:12.190
My mothership watched as I slammed into Tempel 1.

3
00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:18.780
The flash and the cloud of fine powder told scientists what comets are made of inside.

4
00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:23.740
I hit a comet on purpose, on the Fourth of July.
